        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Global Rim Cylinder for Aluminum Store Front Doors</b>\r\n<p>\r\nRim cylinder for use with <a href=\"/products/42-inch-or-less-narrow-stile-crash-bar-exit-device-global-th1100-ed\"><b>Global TH1100-ED Panic Device</b></a>. Packaged with Flat Head screws for counter sinking into the door (Screw head will be flush with doors face).  Can be used on Aluminum Store Front doors, wood doors or metal doors. Available in Aluminum or Dark Bronze finish.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/rim-cylinder-lock-global-th1100-rc\"><b>Global TH1100-RC Rim Cylinder</b></a> packaged with inside mounting plate.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Global TH1100-RC Rim Cylinder\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyed Rim cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Standard 5-pin Schlage \"C\" Keyway</li>\r\n<li>Flat \"cut to size\" horizontal tail piece</li>\r\n<li>For 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Packed with 1-7/8\" diameter trim ring</li>\r\n<li>Includes two (2) #12 x 1-1/2\" phil flat machine screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
